WEBVTT

00:00:03.190 --> 00:00:05.570
A connection is not a model.

00:00:05.570 --> 00:00:12.150
Open Deployments, click Add Deployment, and each provider you enabled appears as a card:

00:00:12.150 --> 00:00:18.310
OpenAI, Ollama, Azure AI Inference, Azure OpenAI and Azure AI Services for speech.

00:00:18.760 --> 00:00:19.916
Choose OpenAI.

00:00:19.916 --> 00:00:24.366
Enter the Model name that the service expects and a Technical name, and

00:00:24.366 --> 00:00:26.851
choose the Connection you just added.

00:00:26.851 --> 00:00:31.244
On the Model capabilities card, declare what the model can do, such as

00:00:31.244 --> 00:00:32.920
tool calling or vision.

